And there's also protein, of course!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.500
"Protein
(Mixed with Water)"
The point is to choose foods that are
high in protein and low in calories!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.290
I'm surprised it's okay to eat so much.

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:26.000
Right, I get it now!

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:31.250
I'm gonna switch to a bodybuilder diet
and lose weight by summer!

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:39.830
But that's sooo haaard...!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.290
--She gave up before she even started!
--I can't eat any fried chicken or ramen...

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.290
Cheer up, Hibiki!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:49.200
There's no need to cut high calorie foods
out of your diet completely.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:55.040
"Cheat Day"
Having a cheat day where you can eat
anything makes your diet more effective!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.330
When you're on a low-calorie diet...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.000
I haven't had enough calories lately.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.620
...your body will eventually think this,
and enter energy-saving mode.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.450
The cheat day counteracts this.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:12.410
By indulging yourself, you trick your body
into thinking it has enough calories.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.290
Oh, I have enough now!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.580
Indulging yourself helps you lose weight?!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.660
Eating as much of your favorite foods
as you want seems to relieve stress, too.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:25.040
When starting out, it's good to have
one cheat day per week.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:28.080
Yesss! I feel like I can do this!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:31.370
Today, I'm revamping my diet!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:33.950
"Omelette Rice"

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:34.950
"Spaghetti Napolitan"

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:35.950
"Steak"

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.370
Let's dig in!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.370
I'll start my cheat day today!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:43.910
I'm gonna stuff myself!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:50.540
No, wait, Hibiki! Your body needs to get
used to a low-calorie diet first,

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.120
otherwise there's no point in having...

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:55.620
This girl just doesn't get it.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.750
Hibiki is still nowhere near her goal...

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.830
Thank goodness...

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.500
I lost enough in time for the event.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:18.660
I cut it close, but I just barely brought
my body to an acceptable level.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.290
Although it's still far from ideal...

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:25.120
Thanks to the careful coaching of
that lovely trainer, Machio-<i>san</i>,

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.950
hitting the gym after work
five days a week wasn't too bad...

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:33.120
Though going to the same gym as my
students was a bit of a pain in the neck.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:37.040
Meh, whatever. They didn't figure
out my hobby in the end, anyway.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:40.040
Getting exposed by students would suck.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.290
Whoa, that cosplayer's
getting tons of attention!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.700
Wow, what a bold costume.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.330
Why are they heeere?!

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.700
Huh? I thought I heard a familiar voice...

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.370
Wh-Why are those girls here?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.790
Could they be looking for me?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.750
Oh! Ha! Found you!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.250
We were looking for you, Machio-<i>san</i>!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.000
Hey, you both showed up!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.830
Why'd you suddenly decide to cosplay?

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:20.080
--A friend invited me to try it out,
but they came down with a summer cold.
--E-Even he's here...

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:23.000
Machio-<i>san</i>, is that costume what I think it is?

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:27.910
Recognize it? It's from the world's first
muscle manga, <i>Lifts with the Straight Bar</i>!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.410
What even is that?!

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.540
Oh, I know that series!

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.870
My older brother collected it!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:38.580
It's a popular manga that was serialized
in the training bible <i>Monthly Muscle Man</i>.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.120
Even your average Joe would know about it!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.330
I've never heard of it...

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.080
Oh, he's from <i>Lifts with the Straight Bar</i>!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.790
The Muscle King is such a badass!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.870
Excuse me, can I take your picture?

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.200
Let me take a picture of you, please!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.660
--Huh? Is it really this popular?!
--Pretty please!

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.250
Could you please strike a pose?

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.290
Of course!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.910
All right, here I go!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:04.750
--How much do your muscles weeeeeeigh?!

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.620
--Complete with a meaningless quote!
--How much do your muscles weeeeeeigh?!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.200
--He said the famous line!
--That pose is from the early editions!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:13.000
--So cool!
--A mirror image of the original!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.120
And the crowd's eating it up!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.500
Man, this takes me back!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.540
Machio-<i>san </i>really resembles him!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.250
Why do you two know about this?

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.120
Am I the only one who doesn't?!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.000
Hey, could you please do that scene?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.620
Ah, that scene!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.500
Then I'll use something long...

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.660
By long, you mean a barbell?

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:36.870
This isn't a cosplay anymore!
And where'd you even get that?!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:42.790
Then please allow me to reenact
one of the story's most famous scenes.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:51.950
My deltoids are all outta juice!

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:54.580
That makes zero sense
and sounds awkward as hell!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.330
That's it! The Muscle King's famous scene!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.580
The Final Front Press!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:02.620
And they absolutely loved it!
Who's the Muscle King, anyway?!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.330
♪ Machio's Muscle Lessons. ♪

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.620
"Trainer Machio's Strength Training Lessons"
♪ Machio's Muscle Lessons. ♪

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:11.500
Now let's learn how to do a front press!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.330
Why'd we suddenly transition to this?!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.750
"Basic Front Press Posture"
The front press trains shoulder muscles!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.660
"Basic Front Press Posture"
We're really doing this?

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.500
Hold the bar from above
with an overhand grip.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.290
Position it just above your collarbone.

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.580
Chest squared, elbows out front.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.000
Don't completely extend your
elbows when lifting the bar.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.080
Lower the bar and return
to your original position.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.250
That's how you do a front press!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:40.540
Warning: Avoid bending your upper body,
or you might hurt your lower back!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:45.290
Keep your upper body straight by
paying attention to your abs and spine.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:50.580
"Deltoid Muscle"
The front press can work out your
front and middle deltoids.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.580
As your shoulders grow wider,
your waist will look skinny in comparison.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.910
I'd also recommend this exercise to women!

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.450
This turned into a training lesson!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.290
I'm exhausted.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.290
"Tired of playing the straight man"

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:08.950
Thankfully, Machio-<i>san </i>attracted so much
attention that I didn't blow my cover...

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:13.000
...but I completely let my guard down.
To think I'd run into my students here.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.790
Well, they didn't see me, so I'm safe.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.080
Wait, isn't that Tachibana-<i>sensei</i>?

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.120
Oh, you're right!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.660
Hey! Fancy seeing you here!

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:22.830
So you came, too!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.870
I... I'm done for.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.330
Huh? Why the suitcase and backpack?

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:32.620
Heh, heh. So that's it...

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:35.370
You came to buy <i>dojinshi</i>, didn't you?

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:39.250
You must be into BL. So you like it, too?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.410
Don't tell anyone at school, okay?

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.540
While a new misunderstanding was born,

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:49.450
Satomi was relieved that her hobby
still remained a secret.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:50.830
"When a serious bodybuilder cosplays lol"
"dafuq?! isn't that the real muscle king"

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:57.000
"When a serious bodybuilder cosplays lol"
"dafuq?! isn't that the real muscle king"
Machio became a minor sensation
the next day after appearing all over the Net.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.830
But who even is the Muscle King?!

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:31.200
Today, we'll review the dumbbell curl!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.790
"Dumbbell Curl"
Today, we'll review the dumbbell curl!

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:36.160
"Dumbbell Curl"
Have anything you could use as a weight?

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.620
"Dumbbell Curl"
Something about 2 kg would be just right!

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:42.370
It should weigh as much as
a big bottle filled with water.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:46.200
You can also fill a bag with books.

00:22:46.200 --> 00:22:47.830
Are you all ready?

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:49.830
Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart.

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:54.330
Relax your shoulders, and slowly
bend your elbows as you lift.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:56.580
It'll be tough once you try it!

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:58.500
We'll start with the right arm.

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:00.370
Ready, set...

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:01.370
Go!

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:07.660
Gently turn your wrists toward you.

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:12.500
Don't bend your elbows too much
or rely on momentum!

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.450
Here we go!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.910
Your muscles are happy, too!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.910
Don't lose your rhythm!

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:21.450
You can push harder!

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.540
This really is hard...

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:27.660
Muscle King, lend me your strength!

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:29.910
Keep an eye on the angle of your elbow!

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:32.580
Last one!

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:35.410
Nice job!

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:38.700
Keep this up, and you'll get firm arms!

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:40.200
And as always...

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:41.910
Nice bulk!

00:23:41.910 --> 00:23:43.580
Now do your left arm!

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:45.660
Try it during the commercial break!

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:47.790
Switch it to your left hand.

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:49.540
Ready, go!
